1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,146
Hello, Admin! Vanakkam!

2
00:00:03,396 --> 00:00:04,897
Let's fill our Sheet together!

3
00:00:06,367 --> 00:00:08,156
We fill the tabs in this order.

4
00:00:10,086 --> 00:00:11,024
One by one!

5
00:00:13,394 --> 00:00:14,497
First, Config.

6
00:00:14,747 --> 00:00:16,373
Type your Persatuan name here.

7
00:00:17,211 --> 00:00:18,412
It shows on the app.

8
00:00:20,866 --> 00:00:21,813
Belts tab.

9
00:00:22,063 --> 00:00:23,529
One row for each belt.

10
00:00:24,031 --> 00:00:26,094
Put them in order: 1, 2, 3.

11
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,937
Type the colour code.

12
00:00:28,439 --> 00:00:29,837
The app paints the belt!

13
00:00:31,475 --> 00:00:32,270
New belt?

14
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,340
Type it on the next empty row.

15
00:00:36,102 --> 00:00:36,763
Easy!

16
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:40,310
Masters tab.

17
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:43,313
Write each Master's Gmail, name and phone.

18
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:46,900
Masters can add their bank details in the app too.

19
00:00:49,438 --> 00:00:50,429
Classes tab.

20
00:00:50,679 --> 00:00:52,193
One row for each class.

21
00:00:52,695 --> 00:00:54,584
Give it a short ID and a name.

22
00:00:55,086 --> 00:00:56,487
Then a place and a time.

23
00:00:58,041 --> 00:00:59,161
Who teaches it?

24
00:00:59,411 --> 00:01:00,337
Tap the arrow.

25
00:01:01,007 --> 00:01:02,057
Pick the Master!

26
00:01:04,763 --> 00:01:05,831
Students tab.

27
00:01:06,081 --> 00:01:07,570
One row for each student.

28
00:01:08,072 --> 00:01:10,252
The IC number is very important.

29
00:01:10,838 --> 00:01:11,846
Check it twice!

30
00:01:13,484 --> 00:01:15,608
Type the IC, name and birthday.

31
00:01:17,286 --> 00:01:19,075
Then pick the belt from the list.

32
00:01:19,997 --> 00:01:21,928
See? The new belt is already here!

33
00:01:23,818 --> 00:01:25,214
Type the monthly fee.

34
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:27,130
Pick Yes for Active.

35
00:01:27,968 --> 00:01:28,547
Done!

36
00:01:31,085 --> 00:01:33,862
Enrolments tab puts students into classes.

37
00:01:34,448 --> 00:01:36,490
One row for each class they join.

38
00:01:38,128 --> 00:01:39,054
Tap the arrow.

39
00:01:39,556 --> 00:01:41,452
Type a few numbers of the IC.

40
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:43,594
It finds the student!

41
00:01:45,232 --> 00:01:46,439
Now pick the class.

42
00:01:47,361 --> 00:01:49,712
New classes show up here by themselves!

43
00:01:52,754 --> 00:01:53,745
Parents tab.

44
00:01:53,995 --> 00:01:55,703
Type the parent's phone and name.

45
00:01:56,289 --> 00:01:58,862
In Children, type the kids' IC numbers.

46
00:02:00,288 --> 00:02:01,729
Put a comma between them.

47
00:02:04,519 --> 00:02:06,422
Access tab says who can sign in.

48
00:02:08,144 --> 00:02:08,990
Pick the role:

49
00:02:09,576 --> 00:02:12,046
Admin, Master, Parent or Student.

50
00:02:14,188 --> 00:02:15,518
Pick Yes for Active.

51
00:02:16,356 --> 00:02:18,361
Now give them a PIN from the app.

52
00:02:21,067 --> 00:02:23,492
Fees tab fills by itself every month.

53
00:02:24,162 --> 00:02:25,580
Green Paid, red Due.

54
00:02:27,554 --> 00:02:29,193
Gradings shows belt tests.

55
00:02:29,695 --> 00:02:31,278
Masters fill this in the app.

56
00:02:32,916 --> 00:02:34,567
Attendance fills by itself

57
00:02:34,817 --> 00:02:36,429
when Masters tap in the app.

58
00:02:36,931 --> 00:02:37,903
Don't type here!

59
00:02:39,709 --> 00:02:41,841
Notices are posted from the app too.

60
00:02:43,563 --> 00:02:46,515
You type: Config, Belts, Masters, Classes,

61
00:02:46,933 --> 00:02:49,447
Students, Enrolments, Parents, Access.

62
00:02:49,949 --> 00:02:51,244
The app does the rest!

63
00:02:51,914 --> 00:02:53,244
Four golden rules!

64
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:55,203
Never change the top row.

65
00:02:55,705 --> 00:02:57,484
Check every IC number twice.

66
00:02:57,986 --> 00:02:59,603
Use the lists when you see them.

67
00:03:00,105 --> 00:03:02,597
Don't delete rows. Set Active to No.

68
00:03:04,319 --> 00:03:05,579
Great job, Admin!

69
00:03:05,829 --> 00:03:06,655
Vanakkam!
